{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.ReebEpsilon"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.q_eq_one_plus_epsilon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.q_eq_one_plus_epsilon","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QFromEpsilon.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Definitional identity `q = 1 + ε`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.qSubstrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.qSubstrate","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QFromEpsilon.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The substrate parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.epsilonValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.epsilonValue","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QFromEpsilon.lean#L57-L57","doc":"Image of the Reeb infinitesimal `ε ∈ Der(A)` in `F` via the\nsurreal embedding. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.oneValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.oneValue","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QFromEpsilon.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Image of `1 ∈ ℝ` in `F`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.add","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QFromEpsilon.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Addition on `F` (left abstract to avoid committing to a\nspecific algebraic structure here). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.F","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QFromEpsilon.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Ordered-field carrier containing both a standard-real subring\nand a positive infinitesimal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon.mk","kind":"ctor","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QFromEpsilon.lean#L46-L46","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QFromEpsilon","kind":"structure","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QFromEpsilon.lean#L32-L61","doc":"**QFromEpsilon**: an ordered-field carrier `F` together with\ndistinguished elements `oneValue`, `epsilonValue`, and\n`qSubstrate` satisfying `qSubstrate = oneValue + epsilonValue`.\n\nThe field `F` is abstract.  Canonical instantiations are\n`F = ℝ(ε)` (rational functions of a formal infinitesimal) and\n`F = 𝐍𝐨` (Conway's surreal field); both are available via\n`QOU.AppendixSurreals`.  The carrier is left abstract here so\nthe structure stays usable without pulling in the surreal\nformalism.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:q-from-epsilon}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-from-epsilon","label":"def:q-from-epsilon","md":"quantum-observable-universe/stochastic-mechanics/q-from-epsilon.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}